{
  "_comment": [
    "Repo-owned Pi model catalog. pulse.sh renders this to .pi-agent/models.json",
    "and points Pi at it with PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR, so the pipeline no longer",
    "depends on ~/.pi/agent/models.json -- a machine-global file that",
    "`ollama launch pi` and `pi update` rewrite (twice on 2026-08-26 alone).",
    "A launcher-written entry carries no thinkingLevelMap, which silently",
    "disables PI_PULSE_SCOUT_THINKING=off, and no contextWindow, which leaves",
    "Pi assuming its 128k default against a 1M-token model.",
    "contextWindow values come from Ollama's own /api/show context_length.",
    "{{OLLAMA_BASE_URL}} is substituted by pulse.sh from PI_PULSE_OLLAMA_BASE_URL."
  ],
  "providers": {
    "ollama": {
      "api": "openai-completions",
      "apiKey": "ollama",
      "baseUrl": "{{OLLAMA_BASE_URL}}",
      "models": [
        {
          "id": "glm-5.3:cloud",
          "contextWindow": 1048576,
          "reasoning": true,
          "input": ["text"],
          "_comment": [
            "GLM-5.3 CANNOT disable thinking: reasoning_effort accepts only",
            "low|high|max (default max) and Z.ai's API answers 400 (code 1210)",
            "on anything else. Ollama does not reject `none` -- it stops opening",
            "the reasoning channel and the model's monologue is emitted as answer",
            "text instead. Measured 2026-08-30: scout with `off` mapped to `none`",
            "wrote 45,149 bytes of chain-of-thought to .tmp/signals_raw.md where a",
            "2.4 KB signal sheet belongs, and it is non-empty so run_pi_retry's",
            "0-byte guard passes it straight through. Hence off/minimal -> null:",
            "check_models.py then aborts the run naming the stage instead.",
            "`medium` must stay mapped because pi hardcodes DEFAULT_THINKING_LEVEL",
            "= medium when --provider/--model are passed without --thinking; an",
            "unmapped level is sent verbatim, the chat template falls back to max,",
            "and distill goes from 48s to 144s on the same input."
          ],
          "thinkingLevelMap": {
            "off": null,
            "minimal": null,
            "low": "low",
            "medium": "high",
            "high": "high",
            "xhigh": "max"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "glm-5.2:cloud",
          "contextWindow": 1048576,
          "reasoning": true,
          "input": ["text"],
          "thinkingLevelMap": {
            "off": "none",
            "minimal": null,
            "low": "low",
            "medium": "medium",
            "high": "high",
            "xhigh": "max"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "gemma4:31b-cloud",
          "contextWindow": 262144,
          "reasoning": false,
          "input": ["text", "image"]
        },
        {
          "id": "kimi-k2.6:cloud",
          "contextWindow": 262144,
          "reasoning": true,
          "input": ["text", "image"],
          "thinkingLevelMap": {
            "off": "none",
            "minimal": null,
            "low": "low",
            "medium": "medium",
            "high": "high",
            "xhigh": "max"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "minimax-m3:cloud",
          "contextWindow": 524288,
          "reasoning": true,
          "input": ["text"],
          "thinkingLevelMap": {
            "off": "none",
            "minimal": null,
            "low": "low",
            "medium": "medium",
            "high": "high",
            "xhigh": "max"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
